[node name="HelpLabel" type="Label" parent="CanvasLayer" unique_id=1064764810]
anchors_preset = 3
anchor_left = 1.0
anchor_top = 1.0
anchor_right = 1.0
anchor_bottom = 1.0
offset_left = -136.0
offset_top = -106.0
offset_right = -24.0
offset_bottom = -58.0
grow_horizontal = 0
grow_vertical = 0
tooltip_text = "Custom polynomial set
Iterate z(n+1) = a6 z^6 + a5 z^5 + a4 z^4 + a3 z^3 + a2 z^2 + a1 z + c
from z(0) = 0.

Let d be the highest active degree and a_d its coefficient.
A point escapes when |z| > R, where R = 2 / |a_d|^(1/(d−1)).
For a2 = 1, this gives the classic Mandelbrot escape radius R = 2.

Max Iter: raises the iteration cap and reveals finer boundaries.
Colors: changes the strength and frequency of exterior bands.
a1-a6: set the real polynomial coefficients from -1 to 1."
mouse_filter = 0
mouse_default_cursor_shape = 2
theme = ExtResource("3_help")
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.9)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 6
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 32
text = "?"
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1

